{"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"interiorPolygons"}],"title":"interiorPolygons","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"interiorPolygons","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNPolygon(py)interiorPolygons"},"abstract":[{"text":"The array of polygons nested inside the receiver.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpolygon\/interiorpolygons"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"readonly"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"NSArray<MLNPolygon *>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"interiorPolygons","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The area occupied by any interior polygons is excluded from the overall shape."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Interior polygons should not overlap. An interior polygon should not have","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"interior polygons of its own.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there are no interior polygons, the value of this property is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyPr